[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435660297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98489#issuecomment-2435660297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98489","id":2435660297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RLToJ","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T15:50:29Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T15:50:29Z","body":"As a side note, I just realized that `XRCamera3D::project_position()` is likely doing it wrong too, for different reasons (the user-provided depth does not currently influence the final x and y components of the projected point).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ff9fb0abea2027c35f0a024297c780648cc806bc/scene/3d/xr_nodes.cpp#L149C1-L177C3\r\n\r\nThe first thing to do would be to write unit tests for `XRCamera3D` too.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435660297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2503226371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98489#issuecomment-2503226371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98489","id":2503226371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VNDQD","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T08:26:17Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T08:34:41Z","body":"For future reference, the key change is really this :\r\n```diff\r\n- Projection cm = _get_camera_projection(p_z_depth);\r\n+ Projection cm = _get_camera_projection(_near);\r\n```\r\nIt avoids using a modified camera projection where the near plane is replaced by the user input `p_z_depth`.\r\nThis produces a degenerate frustum when `p_z_depth == _far` and breaks further steps.\r\n\r\nThe rest just replaces the call to `Projection::get_viewport_half_extents()` with the unpacked logic of this function. This allows taking a plane (`z_slice`) as the input.\r\n\r\nHope it clarifies.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Note** : `Camera3D::_get_camera_projection(real_t p_near)` *really* confuses me. It doesn't only returns the camera's projection as it says, but also adjusts the near plane to the user input.\r\n\r\nAs it's not called anywhere else after this PR but with the current camera's near plane as an argument (which defeats the purpose of having an argument at all ...), I'd take this opportunity to change the definition and completely remove the argument.\r\n\r\nIt's a very small breaking change - as this function is `protected` and may be used in user modules - but worth it IMO.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2503226371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504356864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98489#issuecomment-2504356864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98489","id":2504356864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VRXQA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-27T16:54:05Z","updated_at":"2024-11-27T16:54:05Z","body":"Thanks! Congratulations on your first merged contribution! 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2504356864/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]